{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What does it feel like to be a sentient body part that's attached to another being?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Netherworld, where you play as a sentient tentacle of the great master Chtulu. What happens when a sentient tentacle, wants to find its own purpose? Like get a job? Or rid the world of humanity? Or play doctor at hospital in the Overworld? How would that... work?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel, you take the role of Tenty, and interact with (mainly) dark and humorous characters, that aim to find the cause of a mysterious virus that's been unleashed in the Overworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Choices Matter</strong>: As you interact with characters, some situations may present you with a choice. Act nice or be a temperamental diva? It's up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074610/extras/43e29f4641cd2ec835179ce9a7348485.avif?t=1768741446\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Character Possession</strong>: Sometimes characters will say things that may work against you. You have the ability to possess humans, take over, and say things<i> through them</i> that will shift the outcome of a conversation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074610/extras/87fd89d79caf9806d4a80f1877e2c034.avif?t=1768741446\" width=1182 height=839 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Mysteries:</strong> In a world where everyone is trying to survive, nobody\u2019s motivations are quite what they seem. Use your ability and pick the choices that will reveal character intentions, secrets and memories that could piece together why some characters are either caring, mischievous or simply...morons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074610/extras/8efeedcc769251ee71ba1a1a20b9313c.avif?t=1768741446\" width=1549 height=768 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074610?t=1768741446","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074610?t=1768741446","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074610/cc54700b66f15c10da8a2f47895230c70e8ff8fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768741446","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074610/cc54700b66f15c10da8a2f47895230c70e8ff8fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768741446","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What does it feel like to be a sentient body part that's attached to another being?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Netherworld, where you play as a sentient tentacle of the great master Chtulu. What happens when a sentient tentacle, wants to find its own purpose? Like get a job? Or rid the world of humanity? Or play doctor at hospital in the Overworld? How would that... work?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel, you take the role of Tenty, and interact with (mainly) dark and humorous characters, that aim to find the cause of a mysterious virus that's been unleashed in the Overworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Choices Matter</strong>: As you interact with characters, some situations may present you with a choice. Act nice or be a temperamental diva? It's up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074610/extras/43e29f4641cd2ec835179ce9a7348485.avif?t=1768741446\" width=1560 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Character Possession</strong>: Sometimes characters will say things that may work against you. You have the ability to possess humans, take over, and say things<i> through them</i> that will shift the outcome of a conversation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074610/extras/87fd89d79caf9806d4a80f1877e2c034.avif?t=1768741446\" width=1182 height=839 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Mysteries:</strong> In a world where everyone is trying to survive, nobody\u2019s motivations are quite what they seem. Use your ability and pick the choices that will reveal character intentions, secrets and memories that could piece together why some characters are either caring, mischievous or simply...morons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074610/extras/8efeedcc769251ee71ba1a1a20b9313c.avif?t=1768741446\" width=1549 height=768 /></span></p>","developers":["Llamaplay"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://share