res, befriend the right weirdos, and decide humanity\u2019s fate in this dark humor visual novel where every character is a potential pawn\u2026 or pal.","steam_appid":4074610,"support_info":{"email":"info@llamaplay.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}